WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.002
Video seventeen. Print, Excel, PDF and share.

00:00:05.202 --> 00:00:08.486
Every report and every voucher has the same
keys.

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:12.968
Ctrl+P prints. Ctrl+E exports, for example to
Excel.

00:00:12.898 --> 00:00:17.782
Save as PDF makes a PDF file. Ctrl+M sends it
by e-mail.

00:00:18.082 --> 00:00:21.632
Open a report, for example Bills Receivable.

00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:27.958
Ctrl+P opens the print window: the printer,
the copies, the title and the paper.

00:00:27.988 --> 00:00:31.538
I shows the preview of the page. Esc goes
back.

00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:38.241
In the Windows app, P opens the print window of the
computer. It shows a preview of the pages.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:44.588
For a PDF file, select the printer Save as
PDF. Then click Save, and type the file name.

00:00:44.888 --> 00:00:50.038
Ctrl+E opens the export window. It shows the
format, the folder and the file name.

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:57.885
F8 lists the formats, for example Excel, PDF
and CSV. Type excel, and press Enter.

00:00:57.915 --> 00:01:01.934
E exports the file. The file is a real Excel
workbook.

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:10.941
In the Windows app, a message shows where the
file is: Documents, Hisaab, Exports.

00:01:11.241 --> 00:01:15.324
Press K for the Day Book. Enter opens sales
invoice four.

00:01:17.242 --> 00:01:22.059
Ctrl+P shows the invoice as it prints, with
the GST and the QR code.

00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:27.177
Ctrl+M opens the e-mail. Hisaab fills the
subject and the message.

00:01:27.876 --> 00:01:34.158
Type the address. Ctrl+A opens your e-mail program.
Set up an e-mail profile to attach the PDF.

00:01:34.638 --> 00:01:39.522
Next video: GSTR-1 and GSTR-3B.

